      "text": "Day 25 · After breakfast, group excursion with an English-speaking guide to Tierra del Fuego National Park, Argentina’s southernmost national park and one of the few in the country with a marine coastline: the Pipo River, Mount Susana, Ensenada Bay facing Redonda Island, Lake Roca and Lapataia Bay, among lagoons, beaver dams, mountains, rivers and valleys.",
